<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_16__para_h> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for subsection (8) the following subsection: \"(8) If any member of the State Bar desires to propose any motion to be considered at an extraordinary general meeting convened under this section, he shall, not less than seven days before the date of the meeting, serve on the Secretary of the State Bar a notice of such motion in writing.\". Validation"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
