<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_23__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_23__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "b" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
