<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 4 of the principal Act including the shoulder note is amended by substituting for the words \"Qualifying Board\" the words \"Legal Profession Qualifying Board\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
