<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "All references to the Qualifying Board in any written law or in any instrument, document, bond, agreement or working arrangement subsisting immediately before the date of coming into operation of this Act shall, on and after the date of coming into operation of this Act, be construed as references to the Legal Profession Qualifying Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
