<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@/~cl_4__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The change of name from the \"Qualifying Board\" to the \"Legal Profession Qualifying Board\" shall not affect any powers, rights, privileges, liabilities, duties or obligations of the Qualifying Board, or renders defective any legal proceedings by or against it."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/11/eng@> .
